ge inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/964574/het-eeuwige-vuur.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000352860_Het_eeuwige_vuur_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:21.446Z","sha256":"131b666828b524ec50907ef851a2181f2b0a4d263ae407d44e78ab9d6f4d2019","bytes":91579,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100020,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":928300358,"text":"In het zestiende-eeuwse Europa raken geloof, politiek en persoonlijke verhoudingen nauw met elkaar verweven. Dit deel van de Kingsbridge-romans plaatst de stad en haar wereld in een periode van ingrijpende religieuze conflicten. De inzet van de strijd beperkt zich niet tot het verwerven van macht: ook trouw en liefde worden erdoor geraakt. Follett verbindt individuele levens met de historische spanningen die hun mogelijkheden bepalen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/964574/het-eeuwige-vuur.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789493169517","key":{"isbn_13":"9789493169517"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100021,"title":"De spiegel & het licht","isbn_13":"9789493169517","isbn_10":"9493169510","language":"nld","publisher":"Meridiaan Uitgevers","id":975200091}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789493169517","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169517"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:23.245Z","sha256":"c1c1b79d670c63af5bf2bfa1c655d7529ecd5267c9fcbade881d66bf0a47f3d6","bytes":409083,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789493169517","work_id":975100021,"bound_author_id":928301086,"bound_title":"De spiegel & het licht","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789493169517","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2204:nl","key":{"work_id":975100021,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000606648_De_spiegel__het_licht_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:23.245Z","sha256":"c1c1b79d670c63af5bf2bfa1c655d7529ecd5267c9fcbade881d66bf0a47f3d6","bytes":409083,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100021,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":928301086,"text":"Na de dood van Anne Boleyn probeert Thomas Cromwell zijn positie aan het hof van Hendrik VIII verder te versterken. Zijn afkomst biedt weinig bescherming en hij is aangewezen op inzicht en politieke behendigheid. Terwijl binnenlandse onrust en buitenlandse dreiging toenemen, blijft de gunst van de koning onzeker. Het slot van Mantels trilogie volgt Cromwell in een wereld waarin macht steeds opnieuw verdiend en verdedigd moet worden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1232041/de-spiegel-het-licht.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024570980","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024570980"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100022,"title":"Gouden Zoon","isbn_13":"9789024570980","isbn_10":"9024570980","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200092}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024570980","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024570980"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:25.093Z","sha256":"49ff77a62966dfc2e3dc20e847a1860668d155c9ee2e3c179e2542e4405ac568","bytes":102595,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024570980","work_id":975100022,"bound_author_id":924300157,"bound_title":"Gouden Zoon","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024570980","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2209:nl","key":{"work_id":975100022,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000199526_Gouden_zoon_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:25.093Z","sha256":"49ff77a62966dfc2e3dc20e847a1860668d155c9ee2e3c179e2542e4405ac568","bytes":102595,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100022,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300157,"text":"Darrow kent de samenleving van de Gouden inmiddels van binnenuit, maar zijn afkomst en doel blijven een gevaarlijk geheim. Hij wil de onderdrukking van zijn volk doorbreken en moet daarvoor samenwerken met mensen wier belangen niet vanzelf met de zijne samenvallen. Het tweede Mars-boek volgt zijn manoeuvres tussen vriendschap, politieke rivaliteit en verzet. Wraak kan hem in beweging brengen, maar vormt geen eenvoudig plan voor een andere toekomst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/889536/gouden-zoon.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021461151","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021461151"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100023,"title":"Zo lief als de dood","isbn_13":"9789021461151","isbn_10":"9021461153","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200093}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021461151","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021461151"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000534689_Zo_lief_als_de_dood_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:26.892Z","sha256":"e61717bc9f77e2d0c7a6c4bf2efc13ba1c8f04f8ac345c2130805d4bd6fb6b23","bytes":472244,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021461151","work_id":975100023,"bound_author_id":924300298,"bound_title":"Zo lief als de dood","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021461151","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000534689_Zo_lief_als_de_dood_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2211:nl","key":{"work_id":975100023,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000534689_Zo_lief_als_de_dood_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:48:26.892Z","sha256":"e61717bc9f77e2d0c7a6c4bf2efc13ba1c8f04f8ac345c2130805d4bd6fb6b23","bytes":472244,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100023,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300298,"text":"Een terugkerende bedreiging wordt voor Pip Fitz-Amobi steeds minder abstract wanneer iemand ook buiten het internet in haar leven binnendringt. Ze krijgt onvoldoende hulp en begint zelf verbanden te zoeken met een oude moordzaak. Daarbij vraagt ze zich af of de veroordeelde man wel de juiste dader is. Het derde Moordgids-boek brengt haar onderzoek gevaarlijk dicht bij haar eigen veiligheid en haar vertrouwen in de mensen om haar heen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1515874/zo-lief-als-de-dood.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021053950","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021053950"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100024,"title":"Morgenster","isbn_13":"9789021053950","isbn_10":"9021053950","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij","id":975200094}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021053950","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021053950"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:40.54Z","sha256":"1fb157b7ce9f232abb557bf8cfc4feaeca1d2273112c31d8c217020dbc397a2a","bytes":416033,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021053950","work_id":975100024,"bound_author_id":924300157,"bound_title":"Morgenster","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021053950","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2212:nl","key":{"work_id":975100024,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000679603_De_Mars_Trilogie_3_-_Morgenster_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:40.54Z","sha256":"1fb157b7ce9f232abb557bf8cfc4feaeca1d2273112c31d8c217020dbc397a2a","bytes":416033,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100024,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300157,"text":"Darrow wil een samenleving veranderen die zijn volk als ondergeschikt behandelt. Zijn eerdere infiltratie onder de Gouden heeft hem macht en tegenstanders opgeleverd, maar de voorbereiding op een opstand vraagt meer dan een goede vermomming. In het derde Mars-boek moet hij anderen overtuigen hun verzet te delen. Daarbij botst zijn verlangen naar bevrijding met oude loyaliteiten, persoonlijke wraak en de risico''s van een gezamenlijk optreden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/968991/morgenster.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789020679762","key":{"isbn_13":"9789020679762"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100025,"title":"Dreiging en duisternis","isbn_13":"9789020679762","isbn_10":"9020679767","language":"nld","publisher":"Blossom Books B.V.","id":975200095}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789020679762","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679762"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:42.642Z","sha256":"f617405c1209875d7599187bf764a1d99d205ef085b73bdcfa67bf8f83bcbe82","bytes":110565,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679762","work_id":975100025,"bound_author_id":924300142,"bound_title":"Dreiging en duisternis","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789020679762","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2214:nl","key":{"work_id":975100025,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000073354_Dreiging_en_duisternis_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:42.642Z","sha256":"f617405c1209875d7599187bf764a1d99d205ef085b73bdcfa67bf8f83bcbe82","bytes":110565,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100025,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300142,"text":"Alina en Mal proberen buiten Ravka een ander leven te beginnen, maar haar rol als Lichtheerseres maakt verdwijnen moeilijk. De Duisterling blijft een bedreiging en haar groeiende vermogens brengen ook nieuwe verantwoordelijkheden mee. Terugkeer naar haar land vraagt om bondgenoten die niet vanzelf te vertrouwen zijn. Het tweede Grisha-boek volgt hoe Alina haar verhouding tot macht probeert te bepalen zonder haar persoonlijke verbondenheid met Mal te verliezen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303972/de-grisha-dreiging-en-duisternis.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789020679786","key":{"isbn_13":"9789020679786"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100026,"title":"Val en verlossing","isbn_13":"9789020679786","isbn_10":"9020679783","language":"nld","publisher":"Blossom Books B.V.","id":975200096}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789020679786","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679786"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:44.474Z","sha256":"042f0f139b1c1d23d20faa799ac9ff36fa44ea843ebe16f1dfc5733bdce89d09","bytes":90624,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789020679786","work_id":975100026,"bound_author_id":924300142,"bound_title":"Val en verlossing","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789020679786","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2218:nl","key":{"work_id":975100026,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000116394_Val_en_verlossing_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:44.474Z","sha256":"042f0f139b1c1d23d20faa799ac9ff36fa44ea843ebe16f1dfc5733bdce89d09","bytes":90624,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100026,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300142,"text":"Ravka staat onder het gezag van de Duisterling en Alina heeft maar weinig mogelijkheden om daar verandering in te brengen. Vanuit een verborgen onderkomen zoekt zij met Mal naar een nieuwe kans om weerstand te bieden. De zoektocht naar de vuurvogel en mogelijke bondgenoten vraagt om moeilijke afwegingen. Het derde Grisha-boek verbindt haar opdracht als Lichtheerser met de persoonlijke gevolgen van de macht waarop anderen hun hoop vestigen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1303973/de-grisha-val-en-verlossing.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021456645","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021456645"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100027,"title":"Schakel","isbn_13":"9789021456645","isbn_10":"9021456648","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200097}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021456645","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021456645"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:46.372Z","sha256":"b25837158c4cb57e9cd11b418fb46f3947be5433574ee762b29dcb5472879c20","bytes":100823,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021456645","work_id":975100027,"bound_author_id":924300165,"bound_title":"Schakel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021456645","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2220:nl","key":{"work_id":975100027,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000114128_Schakel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:46.372Z","sha256":"b25837158c4cb57e9cd11b418fb46f3947be5433574ee762b29dcb5472879c20","bytes":100823,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100027,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":924300165,"text":"Een pas gekozen congreslid krijgt een project waarvan de werkelijke bedoeling onduidelijk blijft. Veel later ontwaakt Troy uit een kunstmatige slaap in een wereld waar herinneringen met medicijnen worden onderdrukt. Wanneer hij die medicatie niet meer neemt, begint het verleden zich anders aan te dienen. Schakel verbindt deze verhaallijnen om te onderzoeken welke beslissingen en belangen schuilgaan achter de werkelijkheid van de silo''s.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/484412/schakel.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021475240","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021475240"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100028,"title":"Op één voorwaarde","isbn_13":"9789021475240","isbn_10":"9021475243","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200098}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021475240","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021475240"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1671008/op-een-voorwaarde.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000481382_Op_een_voorwaarde_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:48.201Z","sha256":"c73907fd927a1202014d74e4da947b9c0f82e59c735b5321c71f944a9c5087fd","bytes":615062,"