","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789021475264","key":{"isbn_13":"9789021475264"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100029,"title":"De laatste kans","isbn_13":"9789021475264","isbn_10":"902147526X","language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","id":975200099}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021475264","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789021475264"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000555688_De_laatste_kans_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:50.081Z","sha256":"f5d23180cfbd704eb6caa52d420ab6f7339b5ae4649e70d9bd6f62707ebc2f54","bytes":837617,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789021475264","work_id":975100029,"bound_author_id":975300001,"bound_title":"De laatste kans","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789021475264","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000555688_De_laatste_kans_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2225:nl","key":{"work_id":975100029,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000555688_De_laatste_kans_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:49:50.081Z","sha256":"f5d23180cfbd704eb6caa52d420ab6f7339b5ae4649e70d9bd6f62707ebc2f54","bytes":837617,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100029,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":975300001,"text":"Om aanspraak te maken op zijn erfenis moet Callahan Kane een zomer doorbrengen bij het familiehuis aan het meer. Daar woont Alana, met wie zijn eerdere relatie pijnlijk eindigde. De gedwongen nabijheid roept herinneringen en vragen op die geen van beiden eenvoudig kan negeren. Het derde Dreamland-boek draait om hun poging een houding tegenover elkaar te vinden terwijl oude kwetsuren en hernieuwde gevoelens tegelijkertijd een rol spelen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1749720/de-laatste-kans.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022593356","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022593356"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100030,"title":"Witte dood","isbn_13":"9789022593356","isbn_10":"9022593355","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200100}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022593356","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022593356"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1728823/witte-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1728823/witte-dood.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://metadata.isb