naar een eigen positie zoekt, terwijl een grotere dreiging zich aandient.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/766960/hof-van-mist-en-woede.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022594476","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022594476"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100036,"title":"Koekoeksjong","isbn_13":"9789022594476","isbn_10":"9022594475","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200106}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022594476","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022594476"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/105714/koekoeksjong.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/105714/koekoeksjong.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://www.jkrowling.com/about/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000477178_Koekoeksjong_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:51:12.833Z","sha256":"9c6db2828abfd3d605e2220bba18586326fa0aa5a06e1e2d9dbdf719217e8ff7","bytes":652658,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789022594476","work_id":975100036,"bound_author_id":946301088,"bound_title":"Koekoeksjong","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789022594476","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000477178_Koekoeksjong_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/105714/koekoeksjong.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2519:nl","key":{"work_id":975100036,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-02-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/105714/koekoeksjong.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact edition/title/author/ISBN/format/cover source, not title-based language inference"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/105714/koekoeksjong.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Exact-edition language decision"},{"url":"https://www.jkrowling.com/about/","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Independent identity/content corroboration"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000477178_Koekoeksjong_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T22:51:12.833Z","sha256":"9c6db2828abfd3d605e2220bba18586326fa0aa5a06e1e2d9dbdf719217e8ff7","bytes":652658,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":975100036,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":946301088,"text":"De broer van een overleden model gelooft niet dat haar val van een balkon zelfmoord was. Hij schakelt Cormoran Strike in, een privédetective die zelf met financiële en persoonlijke problemen kampt. Samen met zijn nieuwe assistente Robin onderzoekt Strike de wereld achter het publieke beeld van het slachtoffer. Hun eerste zaak brengt hen in kringen waar reputatie, geld en persoonlijke verhoudingen bepalen wat mensen bereid zijn te vertellen.","source_type":"official_publisher","source_name":"www.jkrowling.com","source_url":"https://www.jkrowling.com/about/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022577240","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022577240"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":975100037,"title":"Zijderups","isbn_13":"9789022577240","isbn_10":"9022577244","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","id":975200107}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022577240","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022577240"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11